<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <style>
    body { margin: 0; padding: 0; font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif; background: #f4f7f4; }
    .container { max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; background: #ffffff; border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); }
    .header { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #2e7d32, #43a047); padding: 32px 24px; text-align: center; }
    .header h1 { color: #fff; margin: 0; font-size: 24px; }
    .body { padding: 32px 24px; color: #333; line-height: 1.6; }
    .body h2 { color: #2e7d32; margin-top: 0; }
    .success-box { background: #e8f5e9; border: 2px solid #4caf50; padding: 24px; border-radius: 8px; text-align: center; margin: 20px 0; }
    .success-box .icon { font-size: 48px; }
    .highlight { background: #f1f8e9; padding: 16px; border-radius: 8px; margin: 16px 0; }
    .footer { background: #f5f5f5; padding: 20px 24px; text-align: center; font-size: 12px; color: #888; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="header">
      <h1>🌿 Green Basket — Merchant</h1>
    </div>
    <div class="body">
      <h2>Congratulations, {{merchantName}}! 🎉</h2>
      <div class="success-box">
        <p class="icon">✅</p>
        <p style="font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:#2e7d32;">Your account has been approved!</p>
      </div>
      <p>Your business <strong>{{businessName}}</strong> is now live on Green Basket. You can start listing your products and receiving orders right away.</p>
      <div class="highlight">
        <strong>Next steps:</strong>
        <ul>
          <li>Add your products and set pricing</li>
          <li>Configure your operating hours</li>
          <li>Set delivery radius and charges</li>
          <li>Start accepting orders!</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <p>We're excited to have you on board. Happy selling! 🚀</p>
    </div>
    <div class="footer">
      <p>© {{year}} Green Basket. All rights reserved.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
